<title>USA: Dow Corning Corp Q3 income rises.</title>
<headline>Dow Corning Corp Q3 income rises.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Mich. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			   1995</p>
<p> Net			$56,400		  $47,300</p>
<p> Revs		     644,300		  624,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: No earnings per share or share data reported.</p>
<p>Dow Corning is equally owned by Dow Chemical Co and Corning Inc.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 includes $15.6 million in reorganization costs vs $2.9 million.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Net profit	    $160,300     loss	70,200</p>
<p> Revs		   1,892,700		1,877,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine months includes $35.5 million in reorganization costs vs $3.4 million.</p>
<p>1995 nine months includes $351.1 million in costs related to implant litigation.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
